# Secrets. Nothing in this project needs one committed — the site is static
# and has no server — but a stray key pasted into a file must never reach a
# public repository. `.env.example` is exempt so a template can still be
# committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials*
secrets.*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
